{"2506480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clue/Cluedo", "steam_appid": 2506480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4772090, 4341730, 4194490, 3659490, 2666740, 3465720, 3252340, 2880150, 2556790, 2556800, 4913040], "detailed_description": "<h1>Save with the Ultimate Edition!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/702e0604b9f02259028367100902a62b.avif?t=1787318375\" width=748 height=896 /></span>Indulge in the ultimate Clue/Cluedo experience when you upgrade to the Clue/Cluedo: Ultimate Edition! Contains the base game, Epic Crime Collection, Tropical Pack and the Suspects Bundle to open up even more mysteries…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Crime Collection: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Black Adder Resort Expansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Black Adder Resort: Case File Revisited #1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispering Pines Retreat Expansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polar Research Station Expansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir Mansion Expansion </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+6 future expansions as soon as they release!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Suspects Bundle: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2016 Suspect Pack, featuring 6 additional playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legacy Suspect Pack, featuring 6 additional playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sherlock Suspect Pack, featuring 4 additional playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tropical Pack, featuring 4 additional cosmetics!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.poster.avif?t=1787318375\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.webm?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.mp4?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔎🗡️ Join fellow detectives all over the world in the official digital board game version of Clue/Cluedo! Gather crucial evidence, interrogate suspects and solve the original murder mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Miss Scarlett, Colonel Mustard, Professor Plum, Chef White, Solicitor Peacock and Mayor Green through the iconic Tudor Mansion, unlocking their motives and alibis as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Clue/Cluedo the way you remember it in Classic Mode, or jump in for a quick game with Clue Cards mode. Alternatively, if you want to really test your sleuthing skills, try a new investigation format available exclusively to Clue/Cluedo – Ultimate Detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ultimate Detective Mode, everyone answers suggestions at the same time…but secretly! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your suspects in a direct interrogation as you rely on your skills of deduction to get to the truth. Experience the mystery, solve the murder and become a top-tier detective!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY CLUE/CLUEDO:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three cards are dealt face-down and set aside – this is the solution to the crime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone is dealt three Clue Cards. These are automatically crossed off your clue sheet, as they can’t be part of the solution. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and move around the board. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter a room, you can make a suggestion – select who you think the murderer is, what weapon they used and where the crime happened. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other players will then aim to disprove your suggestion; if one of your suggestions matches a card in their hand, they show you that card to disprove it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your clue sheet to keep track of which characters, weapons and rooms have been disproven. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’ve figured it out? It’s time to make an accusation! Be careful though – if you’re right, you win, but if you are wrong, you’re out! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.poster.avif?t=1787318375\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.webm?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.mp4?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the beloved original board game, now rendered in stunning 3D animation and entirely ad-free! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/77a5540bf89548989bf7ff8f2f17f29e.poster.avif?t=1787318375\" width=615 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/77a5540bf89548989bf7ff8f2f17f29e.mp4?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive to the digital version of Clue/Cluedo, Ultimate Detective Mode lets you interrogate multiple characters at once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/3d3c202b2dd437dc5404caec31bcaab9.poster.avif?t=1787318375\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/3d3c202b2dd437dc5404caec31bcaab9.webm?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/3d3c202b2dd437dc5404caec31bcaab9.mp4?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened after the shocking events of Tudor Mansion? Find out in a series of original new crime scenes designed specifically for the digital version of Clue/Cluedo! New characters emerge, bringing with them new clues, motives and case files to consider as you travel around the world in search of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/48e56e8540f515ca16f924e1634101b9.avif?t=1787318375\" width=614 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against cutting-edge AI opponents that adapt to your skill level for the perfect game, or challenge detectives around the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/9c164f6134c4413fe5a1bfb6229a25a2.avif?t=1787318375\" width=614 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play a private online match or local multiplayer with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your mind with the iconic murder-mystery board game, now available on Steam! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.poster.avif?t=1787318375\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.webm?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/af639020dd720bc89a3fe93977ce288f.mp4?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔎🗡️ Join fellow detectives all over the world in the official digital board game version of Clue/Cluedo! Gather crucial evidence, interrogate suspects and solve the original murder mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Miss Scarlett, Colonel Mustard, Professor Plum, Chef White, Solicitor Peacock and Mayor Green through the iconic Tudor Mansion, unlocking their motives and alibis as you go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Clue/Cluedo the way you remember it in Classic Mode, or jump in for a quick game with Clue Cards mode. Alternatively, if you want to really test your sleuthing skills, try a new investigation format available exclusively to Clue/Cluedo – Ultimate Detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ultimate Detective Mode, everyone answers suggestions at the same time…but secretly! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your suspects in a direct interrogation as you rely on your skills of deduction to get to the truth. Experience the mystery, solve the murder and become a top-tier detective!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY CLUE/CLUEDO:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three cards are dealt face-down and set aside – this is the solution to the crime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone is dealt three Clue Cards. These are automatically crossed off your clue sheet, as they can’t be part of the solution. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and move around the board. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter a room, you can make a suggestion – select who you think the murderer is, what weapon they used and where the crime happened. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other players will then aim to disprove your suggestion; if one of your suggestions matches a card in their hand, they show you that card to disprove it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your clue sheet to keep track of which characters, weapons and rooms have been disproven. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’ve figured it out? It’s time to make an accusation! Be careful though – if you’re right, you win, but if you are wrong, you’re out! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.poster.avif?t=1787318375\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.webm?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/d4ae9ccbdc110091ba24e3d24591cf85.mp4?t=1787318375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the beloved original board game, now rendered in stunning 3D animation and entirely ad-free! <span class=\"bb_img_ct