orld. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/extras/9c164f6134c4413fe5a1bfb6229a25a2.avif?t=1787318375\" width=614 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play a private online match or local multiplayer with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your mind with the iconic murder-mystery board game, now available on Steam! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Experience a fresh take on the classic crime-solving board game. Step into new mysteries and use your skills of deduction to find out whodunit, with what weapon and where.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/101a9e25124f4d67237b31b4183b441601299030/header_alt_assets_8.jpg?t=1787318375", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/14e2903c50b3e3aeda1ba4a9373a6ab61d103185/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_8.jpg?t=1787318375", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506480/14e2903c50b3e3aeda1ba4a9373a6ab61d103185/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_8.jpg?t=1787318375", "website": "https://www.marmaladegamestudio.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core, 2 GHz single core processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10 class GPU [1280 x 720]<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommende